      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thank you for reviewing this change.\n\nThis patch addresses the inconsistency where refs/meta/config can be deleted through the single-ref path. Currently deleteMultipleRefs short-circuits to deleteSingleRef when only one ref is provided, bypassing the isConfigRef() guard.\n\nI added the missing isConfigRef() check to deleteSingleRef() to match the protection in deleteMultipleRefs.\n\nAdded Release-Notes: skip and fixed the build.\nPTAL.",
